<title>FINLAND: PARTEK TO SELL PROPERTY FOR FIM 145 MLN.</title>
<headline>PARTEK TO SELL PROPERTY FOR FIM 145 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish building materials and cargo handling equipment group Partek Oy Ab said on Friday it sold its Helsinki office property to insurer Vakuutusosakeyhtio Henki-Sampo for 145 million markka.</p>
<p>Partek said it signed a long-term lease for the building and that the sale of the property would not have any significant impact on its 1997 earnings.</p>
<p>The sale was part of Partek's strategy to focus on its core businesses, it said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
